#: ../../source/demos/speed_step.rst:2 300a121ed9364c7c94e91e369708c792
msgid "_`Speed step`"
msgstr "_`速度阶跃`"

#: ../../source/demos/speed_step.rst:4 1884f9f1534847fa8549bdfd69ccf825
msgid ""
"The speed reference steps 0 → 100 rad/s while the current loop stays at "
"20 kHz. The outer loop saturates iq, the plant accelerates, and the loop "
"pulls back before the reference is reached — the classic cascade "
"behaviour."
msgstr ""
"速度给定从 0 阶跃到 100 rad/s，电流环保持在 20 kHz。外环把 iq 顶到饱和，plant "
"加速，环在到达给定前收回——典型的级联行为。"

#: ../../source/demos/speed_step.rst:13 faea711e03104071a71947f3d7e27e05
msgid ""
"Speed reaches the setpoint in about 70 ms; iq saturates during the ramp "
"and collapses to the friction-compensating value once the speed settles"
msgstr "速度在约 70 ms 内到达给定；iq 在爬升段饱和，速度稳定后跌落到抵消摩擦的值"

#: ../../source/demos/speed_step.rst:16 d33fd21facc94391bfe4cf161edc2a10
msgid "measured on the step"
msgstr "阶跃段测得"

