#: ../../source/demos/speed_step.rst:20 53e17619ac9c44bc8c39c4883dc4d0b8
msgid ""
"What to look for: iq hits its limit during the ramp (the loop is doing "
"the right thing, not fighting itself), a small overshoot, and a steady-"
"state error well inside one percent."
msgstr "看点：爬升时 iq 打到限幅（说明环在做对的事，而不是自己跟自己较劲）、超调很小、稳态误差远小于百分之一。"

